<title>POLAND: WEDEL NOV NET DOUBLES TO PLN 6.9 MLN.</title>
<headline>WEDEL NOV NET DOUBLES TO PLN 6.9 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.89 vs   3.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	12.28 vs   7.51</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.10 vs   6.65</p>
<p> Sales		   71.78 vs  54.51</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    35.37 vs  26.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	56.30 vs  50.67</p>
<p> Operating profit    50.93 vs  41.73</p>
<p> Sales		  594.74 vs 414.80</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectioner is Wedel SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
